{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33344","headline":"清晓卷帘 · 欧阳玭","name":"清晓卷帘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晓意未惬，卷帘时一吟。\n槛虚花气密，地暖竹声深。\n秀色还朝暮，浮云自古今。\n石泉惊已跃，会可洗幽心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳玭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}